{
  "app": "Trove",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "released": "2026-10-13",
  "notes": [
    "The first release of Trove, a free archive manager for Windows built on the official 7-Zip 26.04 engine.",
    "Opens ZIP, 7Z, RAR and RAR5, TAR, GZ, XZ, ISO, CAB and the other formats 7-Zip reads; creates ZIP, 7Z, TAR, TAR.GZ and TAR.XZ.",
    "AES-256 passwords for ZIP and 7Z, split archives, safe extraction and a Trove menu in File Explorer.",
    "Trove checks this feed shortly after it starts and at most once a day, and installs a newer version after checking its SHA-256 checksum."
  ],
